direction: down

classes: {
  layer: {
    style: {
      fill: transparent
      stroke-dash: 5
      stroke-width: 2
      border-radius: 10
      font-size: 20
      bold: true
    }
  }
  process: {
    style: {
      border-radius: 4
      stroke-width: 2
      shadow: true
      font-size: 16
    }
  }
  database: {
    shape: cylinder
    style: {
      stroke-width: 2
      shadow: true
      font-size: 16
    }
  }
  ai_model: {
    shape: hexagon
    style: {
      stroke-width: 2
      shadow: true
      font-size: 16
    }
  }
}

Layer 0 OS Sandbox: {
  class: layer
  Container: Container (Read-Only Rootfs) { class: process }
}

Layer 1 eBPF Kernel Data Plane: {
  class: layer
  bpf_lsm Hooks: { class: process }
  Ring Buffers: { class: database }
  BPF Hash Maps: { class: database }
}

Layer 2 Go Control Plane: {
  class: layer
  Go epoll Readers: { class: process }
  Temporal Graph Scorer: { class: process }
  AWS Cedar Policy Engine: { class: process }
  Pluggable LLM Adjudicator: { class: ai_model }
}

Memory and Learning: {
  class: layer
  Vector Embedder: { class: process }
  SQLite Episodic Store: { class: database }
  LinUCB Bandit: { class: ai_model }
  Offline PRM Training: { class: process }
}

# Intra-layer and Inter-layer Connections
Layer 0 OS Sandbox.Container -> Layer 1 eBPF Kernel Data Plane.bpf_lsm Hooks: Syscalls

Layer 1 eBPF Kernel Data Plane.bpf_lsm Hooks -> Layer 1 eBPF Kernel Data Plane.Ring Buffers: Stream Events
Layer 1 eBPF Kernel Data Plane.BPF Hash Maps -> Layer 1 eBPF Kernel Data Plane.bpf_lsm Hooks: Block Signal {
  style.stroke: red
  style.stroke-width: 3
}

Layer 1 eBPF Kernel Data Plane.Ring Buffers -> Layer 2 Go Control Plane.Go epoll Readers
Layer 2 Go Control Plane.Go epoll Readers -> Layer 2 Go Control Plane.Temporal Graph Scorer: Bounded Channels
Layer 2 Go Control Plane.Temporal Graph Scorer -> Layer 2 Go Control Plane.AWS Cedar Policy Engine: Flagged Event
Layer 2 Go Control Plane.AWS Cedar Policy Engine -> Layer 2 Go Control Plane.Pluggable LLM Adjudicator: Policy Miss

Layer 2 Go Control Plane.Pluggable LLM Adjudicator <-> Memory and Learning.Vector Embedder
Memory and Learning.Vector Embedder <-> Memory and Learning.SQLite Episodic Store

Memory and Learning.Offline PRM Training -> Memory and Learning.LinUCB Bandit: Evaluates Trajectories
Memory and Learning.LinUCB Bandit -> Layer 2 Go Control Plane.Temporal Graph Scorer: Tunes Thresholds

Layer 2 Go Control Plane.AWS Cedar Policy Engine -> Layer 1 eBPF Kernel Data Plane.BPF Hash Maps: Compile Policy {
  style.stroke: green
  style.stroke-width: 3
}
Layer 2 Go Control Plane.Pluggable LLM Adjudicator -> Layer 2 Go Control Plane.AWS Cedar Policy Engine: Deny Decision
